#!/bin/bash

brew install --cask raycast

open -gj -a Raycast

cat <<'EOF'

Two manual steps remain:

1. Cmd+Space for Raycast
   - Accept "Replace Spotlight" during onboarding, or set manually:
     Raycast Settings (Cmd+,) > General > Raycast Hotkey > Cmd+Space
   - Free it up from Spotlight:
     System Settings > Keyboard > Keyboard Shortcuts > Spotlight
     > untick "Show Spotlight search"

2. Window management hotkeys
   - Raycast Settings (Cmd+,) > Extensions > Window Management
   - Pick each action (Left Half, Right Half, Maximize, ...) > Record Hotkey

EOF
